{"section":"human","section_count":66,"phase":{"id":"human_phase2","number":2,"label":"Facets Under Pressure","count":16},"questions":[{"uid":"human:human_phase2:QNf1","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P27","question_id":"QNf1","type":"single_choice","text":"I worry about what others think about me.","options":[{"label":"Strongly agree","image":null},{"label":"Agree","image":null},{"label":"Neutral","image":null},{"label":"Disagree","image":null},{"label":"Strongly disagree","image":null}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":"E_R_P2_FCT_QNf1.png","image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_QNf1.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qf2","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P28","question_id":"Qf2","type":"single_choice","text":"How do you handle the positive feelings from a significant achievement to keep moving forward?","options":[{"label":"I feel gratitude and make plans for the next steps","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf2-a.png"},{"label":"I feel satisfied with myself and highly motivated","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf2-b.png"},{"label":"I'm afraid that this won't happen again anytime soon","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf2-c.png"},{"label":"I feel it was just luck and may not happen again","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf2-d.png"},{"label":"I'm just doing my job","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf2-e.png"}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":null,"image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_Qf2-a.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf2-b.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf2-c.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf2-d.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf2-e.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qf3","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P29","question_id":"Qf3","type":"single_choice","text":"If an exercise or training session with your horse isn't going well, what is your main reaction?","options":[{"label":"Stop, analyze the situation, and consider both my technique and the horse's current limits.","image":null},{"label":"Step back and work on simpler things to rebuild our confidence together.","image":null},{"label":"End the session, seek advice from my instructor, and try again another day.","image":null},{"label":"Keep insisting on the exact same exercise, believing we just need more repetition.","image":null},{"label":"No reaction, let it be","image":null}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf3.png","image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_Qf3.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qf4","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P30","question_id":"Qf4","type":"single_choice","text":"How is your confidence affected when you witness a fall or accident at an obstacle ahead of you?","options":[{"label":"It doesn’t seem to affect me at all","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-a.png"},{"label":"I remember to trust my horse, my training and why I’m there","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-b.png"},{"label":"I get nervous and hesitant to try, fearing the same result","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-c.png"},{"label":"It does disturb me, but I still can come back to my focus and my goal","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-d.png"},{"label":"I feel worried, as if it could happen to me","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-e.png"},{"label":"I feel very insecure","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-f.png"}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":null,"image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-a.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-b.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-c.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-d.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-e.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf4-f.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qf5","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P31","question_id":"Qf5","type":"single_choice","text":"How do you deal with defeat?","options":[{"label":"They motivate me even more, even if I feel sad and frustrated","image":null},{"label":"I try to learn from it","image":null},{"label":"They make me doubt if I'm good enough","image":null},{"label":"They simply make me angry","image":null},{"label":"I overthink it and sometimes feel like giving up","image":null}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf5.png","image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_Qf5.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qf6","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P32","question_id":"Qf6","type":"single_choice","text":"When something gives you \"butterflies in the stomach,\" a physical reaction to stress, how does it affect you?","options":[{"label":"It motivates me to do better","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf6-a.png"},{"label":"It makes me scared and afraid","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf6-b.png"},{"label":"I immediately think something bad will happen","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf6-c.png"},{"label":"It speeds up my heart and breathing or causes other physical symptoms","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf6-d.png"}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":null,"image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_Qf6-a.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf6-b.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf6-c.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf6-d.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qf7","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P33","question_id":"Qf7","type":"single_choice","text":"How do you react to something new and challenging?","options":[{"label":"I feel excited, even when I'm apprehensive","image":null},{"label":"I feel fear of what is coming","image":null},{"label":"I feel like I can't handle this","image":null},{"label":"I get irritated by changes","image":null},{"label":"I kind of feel like giving up - and sometimes I do","image":null}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf7.png","image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_Qf7.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qf8","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P34","question_id":"Qf8","type":"single_choice","text":"Your horse suddenly sees something very scary when you are riding and starts to back away. What do you do?","options":[{"label":"Try techniques to calm the horse","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-a.png"},{"label":"I give the horse a moment to calm then continue","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-b.png"},{"label":"I talk loudly to the horse to get their attention","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-c.png"},{"label":"Give firmer commands to regain the horse’s obedience","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-d.png"},{"label":"Freeze with fear, not knowing how to proceed","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-e.png"},{"label":"Feel upset or dissatisfied with the horse","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-f.png"}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":null,"image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-a.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-b.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-c.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-d.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-e.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf8-f.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qf9","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P35","question_id":"Qf9","type":"single_choice","text":"How do you feel before heading into a competition or working towards an important goal at home with the horse?","options":[{"label":"Excited","image":null},{"label":"Stressed","image":null},{"label":"Comfortable","image":null},{"label":"Focused","image":null},{"label":"It does not affect me","image":null}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf9.png","image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_Qf9.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qf10","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P36","question_id":"Qf10","type":"single_choice","text":"How do you feel being the first to compete in an event?","options":[{"label":"I like it because it takes the pressure away","image":null},{"label":"For me, it does not matter when I go in the competition","image":null},{"label":"It matters to me if the ground conditions and environment can change depending on where you are in the list","image":null},{"label":"I don’t like it because I feel I don’t have enough information about the course.","image":null},{"label":"I am not a competition rider","image":null}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf10.png","image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_Qf10.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qf11","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P37","question_id":"Qf11","type":"single_choice","text":"The presence of others watching you ride, whether in a competition or at home, affects your performance by making you:","options":[{"label":"Perform better and enjoy it more","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf11-a.png"},{"label":"I understand that no matter what the outcome, I know my job and who is watching makes no difference","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf11-b.png"},{"label":"Doubt your abilities even more","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf11-c.png"},{"label":"Worry about the possibility of making mistakes","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf11-d.png"},{"label":"Get nervous and find it hard to concentrate on performing your best","image":"E_R_P2_FCT_Qf11-e.png"}],"scales":[],"steps":null,"cover":null,"image":null,"image_refs":["E_R_P2_FCT_Qf11-a.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf11-b.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf11-c.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf11-d.png","E_R_P2_FCT_Qf11-e.png"]},{"uid":"human:human_phase2:Qsp1","section":"human","section_label":"Human / Rider","phase_id":"human_phase2","phase_number":2,"phase_label":"Facets Under Pressure","display_number":"P38","question_id":"Qsp1","type":"single_choice","text":"Are you able to focus and concentrate while riding - whether at home, on a trail, or in competitions?","options":